<thead><tr><th scope="col">Deficiency（缺乏）</th><th scope="col">Distinguishing points（重點）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Zinc（AE／AZD）</td><td>Periorificial + acral eczematous／erosive dermatitis、alopecia、diarrhea；邊緣結痂。<span class="ex-ref">p.2225</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Biotin／multiple carboxylase</td><td>眼鼻口周開始的孔口周圍皮膚炎，與 AE、EFA 缺乏相似；alopecia、conjunctivitis、神經症狀。<span class="ex-ref">p.2220</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>EFA</td><td>Xerosis、scaly diffuse erythema、intertriginous erosions。<span class="ex-ref">p.2204</span></td></tr>
